<h1 class="h2 mb-3">Register</h1>
<div class="row g-3">
  <div class="col-md-6">
    <div class="card h-100">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="h5"><i aria-hidden="true" class="bi bi-building"></i> Register a company</h2>
        <p>For a <strong>contractor</strong>, a <strong>supplier</strong> or a <strong>third-party inspection company</strong> that is new on SiteProof.
           You get the <em>company account</em>, which manages the users of the company.
           The administrator checks your documents before the company can be used.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/register/company" hx-boost="true" hx-target="#main">Register a company</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-6">
    <div class="card h-100">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="h5"><i aria-hidden="true" class="bi bi-person-plus"></i> Register as a user</h2>
        <p>For a <strong>contractor</strong>, a <strong>supplier</strong> or an <strong>inspector</strong> whose company is already registered.
           You choose your company from the list; you can start to work as soon as the company account of your company approves you.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/register/user" hx-boost="true" hx-target="#main">Register as a user</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<p class="mt-3">Already have an account? <a href="/login" hx-boost="true" hx-target="#main">Sign in</a></p>
